<title>GREECE: NATIONAL BANK KEEPS DEPO, LENDING RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK KEEPS DEPO, LENDING RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Bank of Greece said in a statement that its savings and lending rates will remain unchanged.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
